+++            {new Date(timeRange.start).toLocaleString()} → {new Date(timeRange.end).toLocaleString()}
+++          </span>
+++        )}
+++        <span className="italic">（M1 原型：仅当前任务；多任务聚合需 M3/M4）</span>
+++      </div>
